-- Samiti events calendar 2020–2035. Each samiti year runs Poila Baishakh
-- (April) → Saraswati Pujo (next Jan/Feb). Dates 2020–2026 come from the
-- samiti's own records; later years from published panchang (Kojagari and
-- Bijoya Sammelani for future years are estimates — refine nearer the time).
-- Apply locally:  wrangler d1 execute pujosamiti --local --file=seed.sql
-- Apply remote:   wrangler d1 execute pujosamiti --remote --file=seed.sql

